Description: language and input method selection tool
 mintlocale lets users pick the language of their desktop session and the
 regional and time formats to go with it, add or remove the locales
 installed on the system, and install the language packs, spell checkers
 and translations available for the languages they use.
 .
 It also provides a separate tool to select and configure the input method
 framework used for languages that need one.
